  vendorName: Inventor Faraday
  offerText: Fund my revolutionary steam-powered loom! It requires massive space
    for the prototype, but the immediate royalties will make you incredibly wealthy.
  acceptResultText: Faraday dumps a pile of greasy, broken gears in your room and
    runs off with your investment cash! You are absolutely furious and your room
    is ruined.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to fund his delusions. Your room stays clean and your
    wallet stays closed.
  acceptedDelayedText: A rival engineering firm spots the gears through your window,
    realizes Faraday's hidden genius, and buys the scrap from you for a massive fortune!
  rejectedDelayedText: Faraday built his invention next door! The unstable boiler
    explodes, shattering your windows and injuring you, forcing you to pay for the
    extensive repairs.
